{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "20", "m": "10", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "00", "M": "46", "S": "18"}}, "news": [{"title": "Sobha\u2019s net profit declines 55% to \u20b932.95 crore in Q2 FY27", "para": "Sobha reported a 54.6 percent decline in net profit after tax for the quarter ending September 30, 2026. The company's total income also fell by 30.8 percent compared to the same period last year. However, real estate sales value increased by 16 percent year-on-year during the quarter. For the first half of FY27, Sobha achieved record sales value and positive collections.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/sobhas-net-profit-declines-55-to-32-95-crore-in-q2-fy27/135049024?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-51572/135049024.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}, {"title": "Sopra Steria leases 4.74 lakh sq ft office space in Noida for 15 years; rent outlay at \u20b9816 crore", "para": "Sopra Steria India has leased 4.74 lakh sq ft of office space at Maconns Grand in Sector 132, Noida, for 15 years at an initial monthly rent of about \u20b93.76 crore. The lease entails an aggregate rent outlay of about \u20b9816 crore and includes 1,125 car parking spaces, according to Propstack.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/commercial/sopra-steria-leases-4-74-lakh-sq-ft-office-space-in-noida-for-15-years-rent-outlay-at-816-crore/135048453?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-189232/135048453.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "commercial"}, {"title": "UltraTech Cement's profit rises 21.3% to \u20b91,501 crore in Q2 FY27", "para": "During the September quarter, UltraTech Cement reported an impressive 21.27% increase in consolidated profit, reaching Rs 1,501.38 crore. This growth was fueled by an 18.81% rise in operational